      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 登录查询 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP GET 参数 `username`（012.php:5 读取，随后赋给 `$user`）提交任意字符串。该值仅经过 mysqli_real_escape_string 处理（012.php:10 附近对 `$pass` 的处理），而 `$user` 在 012.php:14 被直接拼接进 SQL 语句：`$query = \"SELECT * FROM `users` WHERE user = '$user' AND password = '$pass';\";`，随后在 012.php:15 由 `mysqli_query($GLOBALS[\"___mysqli_ston\"], $query)` 执行。由于查询使用单引号包裹字符串且未做参数化，攻击者可闭合引号注入布尔/联合语句，例如 `username=' OR '1'='1' -- -`，使 WHERE 条件恒真并绕过口令校验。校验无效的原因：代码只对 `$pass` 做了转义与 md5，未对 `$user` 做任何转义或白名单校验，也未使用预处理语句。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 15
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-3b547dba7a60"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-3b547dba7a60",
            "confidence": 0.83,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/012",
            "http_method": "GET",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/brute_force",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 登录接口缺少暴力破解防护（CWE-307）\n\n012.php:3 通过 `if( isset( $_GET[ 'Login' ] ) )` 进入登录处理流程，随后在 012.php:14-15 执行口令校验。代码中未见失败次数计数、账户锁定、验证码、延迟或速率限制等任何反暴力破解机制，攻击者可对同一账户无限次提交口令猜测。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 2,
                  "endLine": 3
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "SEM-536ee862bb25"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "SEM-536ee862bb25",
            "confidence": 0.4,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-307",
            "endpoint": "/012",
            "http_method": "GET",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/weak_crypto",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 使用 MD5 存储/校验口令（CWE-328）\n\n012.php:11 对用户口令执行 `$pass = md5( $pass );`，即使用 MD5 这一已被证明存在碰撞且计算速度极快的散列算法处理口令。该 md5 值随后在 012.php:14 被拼入登录查询与数据库中的口令值比较。MD5 无盐、无迭代、无慢哈希特性，属于口令存储/校验的安全用途误用。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 10,
                  "endLine": 11
                }
              }
            }
          ],
